      "quote": "The U.S. Department of the Treasury has issued a call for Large Position Reports from entities holding positions in the 2-1/4% Treasury Notes of November 2027. Entities with positions equal to or exceeding $4.58 billion as of January 12, 2018, are required to report these positions to the Federal Reserve Bank of New York. Reports must be submitted",
